<span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS2" title="In Appendix C Macroscopic coercivity and the half-turn bound ‣ Accelerated High-Accuracy Sampling from a Warm Startvia the Proximal Bouncy Particle Sampler" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.2 </span>The half-turn operator on affine functions</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS3" title="In Appendix C Macroscopic coercivity and the half-turn bound ‣ Accelerated High-Accuracy Sampling from a Warm Startvia the Proximal Bouncy Particle Sampler" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.3 </span>Proof of
<span class="ltx_ref"></span>:
From affine estimates to the half-turn bound</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Accelerated High-Accuracy Sampling from a Warm Startvia the Proximal Bouncy Particle Sampler" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Technical tools</span></a>
